cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "wcag-alpha-contrast: reference implementation and crawler for alpha-aware WCAG contrast evaluation"
abstract: >-
  JavaScript reference implementation of the extended WCAG contrast ratio
  pipeline, which resolves semi-transparent CSS colours (RGBA and HSLA) to
  their rendered opaque equivalents by Porter-Duff "over" compositing before
  computing relative luminance and contrast. Includes the crawler, the analysis
  scripts and the raw data of the accompanying measurement study.
